,"en":"Let me tell you the beginning."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l016","ordinal":316904,"en":"You are drunk."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l017","ordinal":316905,"en":"If I insult you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l018","ordinal":316906,"en":"You will burn to death,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l019","ordinal":316907,"en":"Baby, you will shed tears."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l020","ordinal":316908,"en":"Let me tell you the beginning."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l021","ordinal":316909,"en":"My son, you look proud."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l022","ordinal":316910,"en":"I was a forest, impenetrable"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l023","ordinal":316911,"en":"I was covered in fire, black road,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l024","ordinal":316912,"en":"I was a shaky black mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l025","ordinal":316913,"en":"I fell down and was humiliated."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l026","ordinal":316914,"en":"My son, lost his hair and tail,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l027","ordinal":316915,"en":"I'm in Sopol."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l028","ordinal":316916,"en":"My horn broke from my head,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l029","ordinal":316917,"en":"I'm a big boy."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l030","ordinal":316918,"en":"I was too much,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l031","ordinal":316919,"en":"I was humbled as a white horse."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l032","ordinal":316920,"en":"I was a black man, my friend."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l033","ordinal":316921,"en":"I was sick as a grandmother."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l034","ordinal":316922,"en":"Wife of Kan Manas -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l035","ordinal":316923,"en":"Kan Semetei mother,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l036","ordinal":316924,"en":"What a wretch I was,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l037","ordinal":316925,"en":"The mother of the birds,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l038","ordinal":316926,"en":"Century is the leader of the nation."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l039","ordinal":316927,"en":"Not forty years, but forty years,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0295:b002:l040","ordinal":316928,"en":"Forty names are forty different,"}]
